            },
            "body": "Hi, @pbkowalski \r\n\r\nThis PR includes all of the changes from #39083 and should merge after it. I left comments on that PR.\r\n\r\nThe new metadata reuse applies only to fp8 extend. Bf16 extend and all decode paths are not impacted. I think the same cache concept could apply there as well, perhaps in later PR. Not a blocker.\r\n\r\nThe changes LGTM.\r\n\r\nThanks.",
